<title>UK: UK 150 mln stg bond tranche due 2003 exhausted.</title>
<headline>UK 150 mln stg bond tranche due 2003 exhausted.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said a 150 million stg tap offer of 2.5 percent index-linked gilts due 2003 was exhausted and no longer operating as a tranchette after the bonds were supplied at 182.09.</p>
<p>The tranche was one of two tap stocks announced on Friday.</p>
<p>The others, a 100 million stg tranche of 2.5 percent index-linked gilts due 2011, has not yet been sold out.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
</text>
